%   data: {"layout":"inline","rightPanelPercent":8.3}
%---
%[output:82e954f8]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"\n找到最优解。\n\nIntlinprog 在根节点处停止，因为<a href = \"matlab: helpview('optim','milp_rel_gap','CSHelpWindow');\">目标值在最佳值的间隙容差范围内<\/a>，options.RelativeGapTolerance = 1e-06。intcon 变量是<a href = \"matlab: helpview('optim','milp_integer_within_tolerance','CSHelpWindow');\">容差范围内的整数<\/a>，options.ConstraintTolerance = 1e-06。\n\n","truncated":false}}
%---
%[output:728f2fd4]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"\n================ 第二周：储能选址定容与交流潮流验证报告 ================\n","truncated":false}}
%---
%[output:3a2a70fd]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"学号: 209230738 | 算例: case_kaifaqu_A | 求解器: intlinprog\n","truncated":false}}
